  "_about": "Edit freely. 'replace' is auto-fixed; 'flag' is reported for a human rewrite (whole-word match); 'tells' are regexes for sentence shapes that need judgement (case-sensitive unless they start with (?i)); 'dead_openers' kill a hook outright; 'number_words', 'tension_words', 'you_words' and 'me_words' feed the hook scorer. The lists are English by default: add the words for any other language your audience uses.",
